  "description": "HiQPdf Next RTF to PDF Converter for .NET (macOS ARM64) is a component of the HiQPdf Next Library for .NET that enables accurate conversion of complex RTF documents to PDF and to Markdown.\n\nThe converter targets .NET Standard 2.0 and can be used in .NET Core and .NET Framework applications deployed on Windows, Linux and macOS, including Azure, AWS, Google Cloud, Docker and Kubernetes.\n\nThis package installs only the macOS ARM64 runtime.\n\nSeparate packages are available for Windows, Linux or multi-platform runtimes.\n\nCompatibility:\n\n* macOS Ventura or later (Apple Silicon / ARM64)\n* .NET 11.0, 10.0, 9.0, 8.0, 7.0, 6.0 and .NET Standard 2.0\n* Web, Console and Desktop applications\n\nMain Features:\n\n* Convert RTF documents to PDF and to Markdown\n* Convert RTF content from .NET strings to PDF\n* Use custom PDF page settings to automatically reflow the content\n* Automatically create a table of contents based on headings in RTF\n* Generate PDF/A and PDF/UA documents\n* Add HTML headers, footers or stamps to the generated PDF\n* Control the PDF document display with PDF viewer preferences\n* Encrypt, set permissions and set passwords for the generated PDF documents\n* Add digital signatures to the generated PDF document\n* Asynchronous methods for async and await\n\nDocumentation and code samples:\nhttps://www.hiqpdf.com/hiqpdf-next-rtf-to-pdf-dotnet",
